  "ai.note": "Tuhipoka",
  "ai.orion81Builds": "Ka hangaia a Orion-81 ki runga i te rorohiko puna tuwhera i tuhia e ngā tāngata. Kua rārangitia ki konei nā te mea kāore i hangaia e te AI.",
  "ai.orion81Completely": "<0>He kaupapa i hangaia katoa e te AI a Orion-81.<\/0> I tuhia ia rārangi o te waehere o Orion-81 anō ki a Claude Code, i arahina e te kaihanga. I hangaia ia waka, ia mahere, ia mata me ia oro e ngā taputapu i tuhia e Claude Code. Ko te kaihanga te kaiwhakatau i te mea hei hanga; ko Claude Code te kaitātai i te huarahi. Kua rārangitia ngā whare pukapuka puna tuwhera e takoto ai ia i raro nei, i raro i te 'Kāore i hangaia e te AI'. Kotahi anō te take e tuwhera tonu ana, e whakaatuhia tūwhera ana: he <1>arotakenga raihana<\/1> o te waehere kēmu i whakawhitia mai i te tauira GPL.",
  "ai.orionBegan28": "I tīmata a Orion i te 28 Mahuru 2026 hei tauira tuatahi ki runga i te pūkaha puna tuwhera Quake III Arena (GPL), me ngā waka o Elite Dangerous hei whakaaweawe. I te rua o ngā rā, ka neke te waehere o te kēmu ki BuB, he pūkaha hou i tuhia ki a Claude Code; i whakawhitia ngā kōwae kēmu mai i te tauira tuatahi, ka whakaingoa anōtia. Nā te putanga 0.3.0 i riro i ngā momo waka 16 katoa he tinana hou nō rātou ake. Kei te tirotiro tētahi arotakenga whakaaro-ki-te-raihana mehemea he mea ahu mai tonu tētahi waehere i te taketake GPL, me te mehemea he tata rawa ngā hoahoa waka tuatahi ki tō rātou whakaaweawe. I whakahaerea he matawai ōrite aunoa o te waehere ki te pūtake o te tauira GPL i te 8 Whiringa-ā-nuku 2026, kei te haere tonu te arotake a ngā tohunga i ōna hononga. Ko tētahi mea kua ahu mai, ka tuhia anōtia, ka hoahoa anōtia rānei.",
  "ai.prevEvent": "Takahanga o mua",
  "ai.quakeIiiArena": "He tohu hokohoko a Quake III Arena me Elite Dangerous nā ō rāua ake rangatira. Kāore a Orion-81 e hono atu ki a rāua, e tautokohia rānei e rāua.",
