  "build.beforeEveryMatch": "I mua i ia tukinga, ka whakarite te mata LOADOUT i tō tinana me tō pare, te tae o te pare, te patu me te aratau o ia tūnga whakapiri, me ngā mea e whakarewa ai tō whare-waka. Ka hangaia ngā waka mai i ngā waahanga e tūkino motuhake ana, ā, ka wāwāhi.",
  "build.breakApart": "Wāwāhi",
