  "economy.diagram.currencyLine": "moni",
  "economy.diagram.desc": "Ara whiwhi: tākaro tukinga, whiwhi moni o roto i te kēmu. Ara hoko: ka hoko te moni tūturu i te moni o roto i te kēmu. Ka eke ngā ara e rua ki te wāhi kotahi: ngā waka, ngā whakapiki waka me ngā whakapaipai, ā, ka hoki ki ngā tukinga. Kua whakaritea, kāore anō kia hangaia.",
