  "economy.showEarn": "Whakaatu i te ara whiwhi",
  "economy.showEarnSub": "Tākaro tukinga, whiwhi moni o roto i te kēmu",
  "economy.todayHead": "Ngā mea kei te noho ināianei",
  "economy.todayLead": "Ko ngā taumata tinana me te pare me ngā tae pare o te mata LOADOUT (0.6.0) e whakaatu ana i te momo whakapiki me te whakapaipai e whāia ana e te ōhanga.",
  "faq.becauseRevenueMeant": "Nā te mea ko ana moni whiwhi hei utu i a rātou. Ka tīmata te kēmu he mea hanga katoa e te AI kia taea ai te noho; kātahi ka whakakapi ngā kaihoahoa utua i ngā mahi a te AI, me te whakaingoa i a rātou.",
  "faq.canIPlay": "Ka taea te tākaro ā-ipurangi?",
  "faq.freePlay": "He kore utu hei tākaro?",
  "faq.n07Questions": "07 · Ngā pātai",
  "faq.notYetLan": "Kāore anō. Ka mahi te tākaro maha-kaitākaro LAN i runga i te whatunga kotahi i tēnei wā (mai i te 0.2.0); kāore anō kia hangaia te tākaro ā-ipurangi.",
  "faq.prototypeWasBuilt": "I hangaia te tauira tuatahi ki runga i te pūkaha puna tuwhera Quake III Arena (GPL), ā, i tango i ngā waka o Elite Dangerous hei whakaaweawe. I te rua o ngā rā, ka neke te waehere o te kēmu ki BuB, he pūkaha hou i tuhia ki a Claude Code; i whakawhitia ngā kōwae kēmu mai i te tauira tuatahi, ka whakaingoa anōtia. Nā te putanga 0.3.0 i riro i ngā momo waka 16 katoa he tinana hou. Kei te tirotiro tētahi arotakenga whakaaro-ki-te-raihana mehemea he mea ahu mai tonu tētahi waehere i te taketake GPL, me te mehemea he tata rawa ngā hoahoa waka tuatahi ki tō rātou whakaaweawe. I whakahaerea he matawai ōrite aunoa o te waehere ki te pūtake o te tauira GPL i te <0/>, ā, kei te haere tonu te arotake a ngā tohunga i ōna hononga. Ko tētahi mea kua ahu mai, ka tuhia anōtia, ka hoahoa anōtia rānei. Kia oti ra anō te arotakenga, kāore mātou e kī ko te whakautu he kāo.",
  "faq.questions": "Ngā pātai",
  "faq.shipsArtInterface": "Ngā waka, ngā toi, te atanga me ētahi atu, i te wā e taea ana e ngā moni whiwhi. Ko <0>te rārangi o tēnei whārangi<\/0> te rārangi i ia wāhanga, ā, ka whakaatu i ia whakakapinga me tana kaihoahoa.",
  "faq.shipsUpgradesPlanned": "E whakaritea ana kia taea te whiwhi, te hoko rānei ngā waka me ngā whakapiki. Kei te hoahoatia tonuhia te āhua e tika ai ngā waka utu i te tākaro tangata-ki-te-tangata.",
  "faq.thatPlanFree": "Koia te mahere: kore utu hei tākaro me te moni kōwhiri o roto i te kēmu me ngā whakapaipai. Kāore anō kia hangaia.",
  "faq.wasAnyoneS": "I tāruatia te mahi a tētahi?",
  "faq.whenOutWhat": "Ahea ka puta, ā, ki runga i te aha?",
  "faq.whichPartsWill": "Ko ēhea wāhanga ka whakakapia e te tangata, ā, ka pēhea taku mōhio?",
  "faq.whyWouldAi": "He aha ai e āwhina ai te kēmu i hangaia e te AI i ngā kaihoahoa?",
  "faq.willPayWin": "Ka waiho hei kēmu utu-kia-wikitoria?",
  "faq.windowsPcThere": "PC Windows. Kāore anō he rā tuku, he utu rānei.",
  "footer.anthropicClaudeClaude": "He tohu hokohoko a Anthropic, Claude me Claude Code nā Anthropic, PBC. He tohu hokohoko a Unreal Engine me Epic Games nā Epic Games, Inc. He tohu hokohoko a Blender nā te Blender Foundation. He tohu hokohoko a Quake III Arena me Elite Dangerous nā ō rāua ake rangatira. Nō ō rātou rangatira ngā ingoa katoa, ā, e whakamahia ana hei tautuhi noa i ngā hua e kōrerotia ana. Kāore a Orion-81 e hono atu ki tētahi o rātou, e tautokohia ā-pūtea e tētahi o rātou, e whakaaetia rānei e tētahi o rātou.",
  "footer.aspirationalNoPartnership": "Tūmanako noa. Kāore he mahi tahi, he hononga, he whakaae rānei e noho ana.",
  "footer.channelComing": "Ka tae mai te hongere",
  "footer.devlogYoutube": "Rangitaki whakawhanake i YouTube",
  "footer.followKickstarter": "Whai i te Kickstarter",
  "footer.futurePartners": "Hoa mahi anamata?",
  "footer.noTrackersNo": "Kāore he kaituruturu. Kāore he kuki. Paetukutuku arokite. Ka kitea te pūtake o ia meka i te pūranga o te kaupapa; ehara tētahi mea o konei i te tuku, i te oati rānei.",
  "footer.notLiveYet": "Kāore anō kia ora",
  "footer.oneItemStill": "Kotahi anō te take e tuwhera tonu ana: te <0>arotakenga raihana<\/0> o te waehere kēmu i whakawhitia mai i te tauira GPL. I whakahaerea he matawai ōrite aunoa o te waehere ki te pūtake o te tauira i te <1/>, ā, kei te haere tonu te arotake a ngā tohunga i ōna hononga.",
  "footer.orion81Completely": "<0>He kaupapa i hangaia katoa e te AI a Orion-81.<\/0> Ko te waehere o Orion-81 anō nā Claude Code, i arahina e te kaihanga; ko ngā waka, ngā mahere, ngā mata me ngā oro i hangaia e ngā taputapu i tuhia e Claude Code. Kua rārangitia ngā whare pukapuka puna tuwhera e whakamahia ana e ia i raro i te <1>'Kāore i hangaia e te AI'<\/1>.",
  "footer.siteFooterAriaLabel": "Waewae o te paetukutuku",
  "hero.behindThisPlate": "Kei muri i tēnei papa: te tauira ORION-1 o roto i te kēmu mai i te putanga 0.6.1, e whakaatuhia ora ana i tō kaitirotiro (kua whakawhitia mō te tukutuku, kua whakaitia te mata ki te 512 px).",
  "hero.behindThisPlate2": "Kei muri i tēnei papa: he hopu o roto i te kēmu mai i te putanga 0.6.1. Kua weto te 3D ngangahau i tēnei pūrere.",
