  "styles.scene.mediumWhat": "He whakaahua kua tuhia te raupapa whakarewa i hangaia mō tēnei paetukutuku, ehara i ngā ataata kēmu; nō te tauira ANVIL ngā tūnga whare-waka.",
  "styles.scene.smallLabel": "Whakaaturanga 3D: he KESTREL me tētahi waka whawhai NEEDLE i tētahi whawhai huri, me te ahi rēhi. Whakaahua kua tuhia, ka taea te huri.",
  "styles.scene.smallWhat": "He whakaahua kua tuhia te whai, te hiki-taha me te ahi rēhi i hangaia mō tēnei paetukutuku, ehara i ngā ataata kēmu.",
