  "why.anthropic": "Mō Anthropic",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic": "<0>Te Taupū Ōhanga a Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> e kitea ana ko ngā kaimahi kua tīmata tonu i tō rātou umanga te nuinga o ā rātou mahi ka kitea e taea ana e te AI.",
  "why.anthropicSEconomic2": "<0>Te anga kaupapa here ōhanga a Anthropic (<1/>)<\/0> e tono ana i ngā kamupene kia whakangungu anō, kia whakanoho anō i ngā tāngata, kaua e tapahi.",
  "why.anthropicSReview": "<0>Te arotake a Anthropic mō ngā taunakitanga whakangungu anō (<1/>)<\/0> e kitea ana he pai rawa ngā hōtaka e hono ana ki te kaituku mahi, ā, motuhake ki tētahi rāngai.",
  "why.askSimpleFive": "He māmā te tono: e rima ngā tūru Claude hei tīmatanga. Mēnā ka taea e te kaihanga te whakakī ki ngā tāngata pūmanawa, hihiri, ka whakaatu mātou i te āhua e taea ai te whakamahi i te AI me te whakaaro pai hei hanga i tētahi mea ataahua.",
  "why.context": "Horopaki",
  "why.designersEngineers": "Mō ngā kaihoahoa me ngā kaipukaha",
  "why.everyItemBelow": "He mahere, he mea e whanga ana kia panuitia ia mea kei raro iho nei. Kāore tētahi mea o konei i whakaaetia, ā, kāore he tau e oatitia.",
  "why.founderWentFrom": "I haere tētahi kaihanga mai i te tauira tuatahi ki te 0.6.1 i roto i te <0/> rā. Whakaarohia he aha ka taea e tētahi rōpū e rima kua ū.",
  "why.fromAnthropic": "Nā Anthropic",
  "why.fromBackers": "Nā ngā kaitautoko",
  "why.fullyDisclosedAi": "He kēmu hangaia e te AI kua whakaaturia katoatia, me tētahi whāinga ka taea e ngā kaitākaro te tirotiro, e whakaritea ana kia neke ki Unreal Engine 5 (wāhanga 3 o te mahere ara).",
